Error [E0218]: `pin` needs a write window made with the write-capability marker `&` into the place being pinned
  --> tests/ui/pin_needs_write_window.jet:7:23
    |
  7 |     pinned :: mem.pin(node)
    |                       ^^^^
 Why: a pin promises one storage location will not move, so it has to name that location with the write-capability marker `&` instead of a copied value
 Fix: write `mem.pin(&place)` with the write-capability marker `&`
